The '''Prof. Wild Base''' is an animated [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] that appears in [[Prof. Wild's Challenge]]. It was added in [[Version 6.8 Update|Version 6.8]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Prof. Wild Base
|image = E 386.png
|appearance = [[Prof. Wild's Challenge]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
It is immune to most negative effects, like other bases. It has very long attack range, about 1/3 the field of the first stage it appears in.

